  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the constant term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>.</mo><mi>l</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;is an odd integer, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "I9a4P",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>",
